From 3347765c5a25b7cc7cf2ea839997929f39daa11e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Paul Tarjan <github@paulisageek.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 19:29:19 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] Snapshot rust/src from the live /Users/pt/tta-ai tree as
 the new replay base

/Users/pt/tta-ai/rust/src is untracked and is the code the league actually
runs; it is ahead of this scratch lineage in files the 3 fixes being
replayed (0170f8f, 1608f67, f3c78a0) never touched -- notably an Age A
first-replenish rules fix in game.rs and a confirmed_legal_moves fix in
advisor/advisor.rs. This commit replaces rust/src wholesale with an exact
copy of the live tree (rsync --delete), so those fixes are never at risk of
being reverted by the replay. rust/src/bin/leafdump.rs is removed because
it does not exist in the live tree. rust/Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock, .gitignore,
DESIGN.md, tests/, and trainer/ were diffed against live and found
byte-identical -- no other changes needed.
