From 1374995506033eb6bea470df6a10b9d78a40981a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Paul Tarjan <github@paulisageek.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 19:08:50 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] Add WeightKey::HasColony: price the Annex-target cliff
 separately from the colony count

RULES_SPEC 5.4 / legal.rs's aggression_target_qualifies gate Annex on
q.colonies.is_empty() -- holding at least one colony makes a player a
legal Annex target, a binary step at 0->1 colonies that the existing
linear WeightKey::Colonies (already priced for production/culture/
science/strength benefits, and for event exposure via
EventScoringMargin) cannot express. Mirrors WeightKey::HasUnit's
existing cliff-not-slope shape exactly. Seeded at 0.0 and left Free (no
sign_intent) -- the direction is unmeasured and left for the league to
climb, not hardcoded.

(cherry picked from commit f3c78a0ae2799f71b43b86cdd031be724b60c65d)
